# Honeytoon

> Honeytoon is an online webtoon and digital comics platform with a focus on story-driven digital comics across popular genres like romance, drama, action, thriller, and supernatural. Users read vertically scrolling comics on desktop and mobile, with access provided via subscriptions and coins. The service supports multiple interface languages (English, French, German, Spanish, Portuguese, Italian).

## Main pages

- [Homepage](https://honeytoon.com/): Landing page that highlights featured series, “Rising Stars”, “Fan Favorites”, and “Something New”, as well as promotional banners for premium plans and special offers.

- [Comics genres](https://honeytoon.com/genres): Main catalog of comics grouped by genre (Romance, Action, Office, Thriller, Drama, Supernatural, etc.). The page shows popular titles with tags, episode counts, and ratings, and allows sorting by “Most Popular”, “New titles”, and “Last updates”.

- [Ranking](https://honeytoon.com/ranking): Discovery page that highlights trending and fresh stories, new releases, and popular series across genres, helping users find what other readers are currently enjoying.

- [Manga genres](https://honeytoon.com/manga-genres): Section focused on manga titles; promotes manga as a separate reading category and entry point for users who prefer Japanese/Korean/Chinese-style comics.

- **User account and library** (authenticated):
  - “My Library” – user’s saved and recently read comics, subscription status, and coin balance.
  - Account-level pop-ups and flows for sign up, login, password reset, payment issues, and age verification.

