## Content structure and comics

- **Series pages**:  
  Each series is available under URLs like `https://honeytoon.com/comic/<series-slug>`. A series page typically includes:
  - cover image, title, short description;
  - genre tags and sometimes rating;
  - total number of episodes and status (e.g. “END” for completed series);
  - list of episodes with release dates, noting which episodes are free and which require coins or membership.

- **Episode pages**:  
  Individual episodes use URLs like `https://honeytoon.com/comic/<series-slug>/<episode-number>`. Episodes present a sequence of comic panels rendered as vertical images optimized for scrolling. Navigation allows moving to the previous/next episode and returning to the episode list.

